// Nagasaki state (maxVolEver, canonical one-state Nagasaki (HV law): bar[1] is the all-time-high-volume candle iff volume[1] > every earlier candle); the HWS section reads its bar[0] view. Default ON unchanged. EXCEPTIONS: CHECKBOX
